        "template--14667687166065__8137d931-8d8f-467c-8d80-cbe4196cfa7e-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>WHAT IS A CAPSULE WARDROBE?</h2><p>A capsule wardrobe is a curated collection of essential,versatile clothing items that can be mixed and matched to create a wide range of outfits.  The key principles of a capsule wardrobe are quality over quantity, versatility and longevity.  With fewer items, you can focus on quality, reduce clutter and simplify your daily routine.</p><h2>WHY BLEUSALT FOR YOUR CAPSULE WARDROBE?</h2><p>Bleusalt's commitment to sustainability and unparalleled comfort makes it a perfect choice for a capsule wardrobe paired with your tried and true accessories and outerwear.</p><h2>WHAT IS BLEUSALT'S CURATE YOUR CAPSULE PROGRAM?</h2><p>Bleusalt's \"Curate Your Capsule\" program allows you to curate which items you wish to build your capsule wardrobe with.  Simply shop our website as you would normally and add your desired items to your shopping cart.  However, the larger your capsule gets, we apply discounts at certain intervals.  Buy 3+ items, save 10%, 5+ items, save 15%, and 7+, save 20%.  Get an additional 10% when you shop through <a href=\"/pages/download-the-bleusalt-app\" title=\"GET THE BLEUSALT APP\">The Bleusalt App</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
